Tracks.description:
The log of runtime deformation's stamps: stamps held, pressed and dropped by
the deformation budget, and the newest. Read tracks with deformation_query;
press one with the deform control.

max_resident_pages.description:
An optional budget of streamed pages (128 KiB each) kept resident;
beyond it the least recently used make room, and pinned pages always
stay. Omitted, only the device's limits bound them.
